  "releaseNotes": "v0.6.3 (2026-06-26):\n\n            PERFORMANCE:\n            - Async callback (IQData mode): single-pass enqueue, no intermediate IQData[] allocation\n            - Async callback: skip SamplesAvailableEventArgs allocation when there are no subscribers\n            - Synchronous ReadSamples: pooled ArrayPool buffer and fixed pinning instead of GCHandle + new byte[]\n\n            FIXED:\n            - Synchronous ReadSamples no longer leaks its scratch buffer on read-error exception paths\n\n            CHANGED:\n            - ReadSamples validates requestedSamples (negative/oversized throw ArgumentOutOfRangeException)\n\n            See CHANGELOG.md for complete details.",
